# RESEARCH ARTIFACT (Phase 2, 2026-07-04) -- NOT a gate entry; kept as documentation.
# At-dismissal stale-window capture: with truth-capture mode on (ROGER_TRUTH_CAPTURE=1),
# the pending `capture atdismiss` is consumed by the DISMISS present itself
# (presentWithUi bounded path, Diag-verified), i.e. the earliest reachable capture point.
#
# Finding: this scenario CANNOT detect invalidation-fault injections. Post-Phase-1
# invalidation is layered -- the UI-layer _dirtyPrev loop, the scene seed union
# (incl. the deferred-vacate cover), and compose-time dirtying each independently
# reseed the vacated region -- so the captures stay clean even with all three
# invalidation marks AND renderUiLayer's per-element dirty-adds disabled.
# See docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-03-roger-phase2-diff-net.md (Amendment/Resolution).
#
# Technique notes (reusable): no move between `capture` and the dismissing key --
# a move fires a cursor-only present that would consume the pending capture early.
# QFG1 save slot 3 -> room 320 (market street).
wait 4500
capture base
move 160 100
wait 500
type "look"
wait 900
key ENTER
wait 2500
# Dialog is now blocking (kernelAnimate frozen, _dirtyPrev = showRect text rect only).
# The pending capture stays here until the dismiss present consumes it.
capture atdismiss
key enter
# Dismiss fires bitsRestore/onWindowClose -> presentBarrier -> presentWithUi (bounded).
# With marks: dialog rect in _dirtyCur -> full dialog cleared. Without: only text
# area (from _dirtyPrev) cleared, border pixels stale -> sameRunDiff FAILS under injection.
# maybeScriptCapture fires after presentToOverlay via grabOverlay (truth mode).
wait 400
capture healed
move 160 100
wait 500
quit
